			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Migrate transport layer to PascalCase naming\n\nRename transport modules to follow PascalCase convention:\n- GrpcTransport.rs → gRPCTransport.rs\n- IPCTransport.rs → IPCTransport.rs (replaces IpcTransport.rs)\n\nUpdate all method names and struct fields from snake_case to PascalCase:\n- `new()` → `New()`, `with_config()` → `WithConfiguration()`\n- `connection_timeout` → `ConnectionTimeout`, `max_retries` → `MaximumRetries`\n- `as_grpc()` → `AsgRPC()`, `as_ipc()` → `AsIPC()`\n\nUpdate module paths in Strategy.rs, mod.rs, and throughout Grove to reference `Transport::Strategy::Transport` and the renamed modules. Update public API functions in mod.rs: `create_default_transport()` → `CreateDefaultTransport()`, etc.\n\nAlso fix README.md link from /why-webassembly to /why-wasm.\n\nThis completes the PascalCase migration for the Grove transport layer, ensuring consistency with the project's naming conventions.",
